                "original": "We <b>flew</b> to Paris last weekend, but we <b>didn't see</b> the Eiffel Tower.",
                "translate": "В прошлые выходные мы летали в Париж, но не видели Эйфелеву башню. (flew / didn't see)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 45,
                "original": "We <b>went</b> to the cinema, but we <b>didn't like</b> the film.",
