                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 46,
                "original": "Maria and her husband <b>were</b> here, but we <b>didn't talk</b> to them.",
                "translate": "Мария с мужем были здесь, но мы с ними не разговаривали. (were / didn't talk)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
